        "htmlContent": "<section class=\"tool-step\" id=\"materialsTool\">\n  <header class=\"tool-step-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Compose · reuse · preserve</span><h3>Materials &amp; Solutions</h3><p>Choose known substances from the Lab Cabinet or compose a project recipe visually.</p></div><div class=\"row wrap\"><button class=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"cabinet-selector\" data-cabinet-category=\"materials\">Choose material</button><button class=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"cabinet-selector\" data-cabinet-category=\"solutions\">Choose solution</button><button class=\"button primary\" type=\"button\" data-materials-new>+ Create solution</button></div></header>\n  <div class=\"materials-overview\" data-materials-overview></div>\n  <section class=\"project-material-shelf\" data-project-materials hidden><header><span class=\"eyebrow\">Selected from Cabinet</span><strong>Project substances</strong></header><div data-project-material-list></div></section>\n  <div class=\"record-grid\" data-materials-list></div>\n  <div class=\"useful-empty\" data-materials-empty><strong>No Project solutions yet</strong><small>Create one here; it becomes structured input for Stack &amp; Fabrication.</small></div>\n  <form class=\"panel tool-editor progressive-editor\" data-materials-editor hidden>\n    <div class=\"panel-header\"><div class=\"panel-title\"><strong data-solution-editor-title>Solution Builder</strong><small>Essential composition first · experimental detail when useful</small></div><button class=\"icon-button\" type=\"button\" data-materials-close aria-label=\"Close\">×</button></div>\n    <div class=\"solution-workbench\">\n      <section class=\"solution-live-stage\" aria-label=\"Live solution composition\" data-solution-visual></section>\n      <div class=\"panel-body form-grid\">\n      <div class=\"field span-2 required-field\"><label>Name <span class=\"field-level\">Required</span></label><input class=\"input\" name=\"name\" required></div>\n      <div class=\"field recommended-field\"><label>Concentration <span class=\"field-level\">Recommended</span></label><input class=\"input\" name=\"concentration\" placeholder=\"1.2 M\"><small>Useful for reproducibility and comparison.</small></div>\n      <div class=\"field recommended-field\"><label>Total volume <span class=\"field-level\">Recommended</span></label><div class=\"compound-input\"><input class=\"input\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.1\" name=\"totalVolume\"><select class=\"input\" name=\"volumeUnit\"><option>mL</option><option>µL</option><option>L</option></select></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"component-columns progressive-components\">\n      <section class=\"component-well solvent-well\"><header><div><span class=\"component-symbol\">∿</span><strong>Solvent phase</strong><small>Liquid carrier · ratio by volume</small></div><button class=\"button small\" type=\"button\" data-add-solvent>Add solvent</button></header><div data-solvent-list></div></section>\n      <section class=\"component-well solute-well\"><header><div><span class=\"component-symbol\">◇</span><strong>Solutes &amp; additives</strong><small>Dissolved species · target amount</small></div><button class=\"button small\" type=\"button\" data-add-solute>Add solute</button></header><div data-solute-list></div></section>\n    </div>\n    <datalist id=\"cabinetSolvents\"></datalist><datalist id=\"cabinetSolutes\"></datalist>\n    <details class=\"progressive-details progressive-block\">\n      <summary>Recommended preparation details <span>Optional · useful later</span></summary>\n      <div class=\"progressive-detail-body form-grid\">\n        <div class=\"field recommended-field\"><label>Preparation <span class=\"field-level\">Recommended</span></label><textarea class=\"input\" name=\"preparation\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Mixing, stirring, heating, filtering…\"></textarea><small>Helps reproduce the solution without blocking creation.</small></div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><label>Handling / before use</label><textarea class=\"input\" name=\"handling\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Filter, warm, age, protect from light…\"></textarea></div>\n        <div class=\"field span-2\"><label>Storage</label><input class=\"input\" name=\"storage\" placeholder=\"e.g. N₂ glovebox · dark · room temperature\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n    <details class=\"progressive-details progressive-block\"><summary>Advanced metadata <span>Only when needed</span></summary><div class=\"progressive-detail-body form-grid\"><div class=\"field span-2\"><label>Notes</label><textarea class=\"input\" name=\"notes\" rows=\"2\"></textarea></div><label class=\"check-row span-2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"saveCabinet\"><span><strong>Save also to Lab Cabinet</strong><small>The Project keeps its own session snapshot.</small></span></label></div></details>\n    <div class=\"panel-footer\"><span class=\"subtle\">Required composition is enough to continue. Recommended details remain editable later.</span><button class=\"button primary\" type=\"submit\">Save solution</button></div>\n  </form>\n</section>\n"
