        "htmlContent": "<section class=\"tool-step\" id=\"stackTool\">\n  <header class=\"tool-step-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Structure · process · evidence</span><h3>Stack &amp; Fabrication</h3><p>Build the device as an ordered cross-section, then attach the operations that created it.</p></div><div class=\"row wrap\"><button class=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"cabinet-selector\" data-cabinet-category=\"materials\">Choose material</button><button class=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"cabinet-selector\" data-cabinet-category=\"stacks\">Choose stack</button><button class=\"button primary\" type=\"button\" data-stack-new>+ Create stack</button></div></header>\n  <div class=\"stack-overview-strip\" data-stack-overview></div>\n  <div class=\"record-grid\" data-stack-list></div><div class=\"useful-empty\" data-stack-empty><strong>No stacks yet</strong><small>Create a graphical stack; saved Project solutions remain available as scientific context.</small></div>\n  <form class=\"panel tool-editor progressive-editor\" data-stack-editor hidden>\n    <div class=\"panel-header\"><div class=\"panel-title\"><strong>Stack Builder</strong><small>Structure and fabrication are related but kept distinct.</small></div><button class=\"icon-button\" type=\"button\" data-stack-close aria-label=\"Close\">×</button></div>\n    <div class=\"panel-body form-grid\"><div class=\"field required-field\"><label>Name <span class=\"field-level\">Required</span></label><input class=\"input\" name=\"name\" required></div><div class=\"field recommended-field\"><label>Variant / condition <span class=\"field-level\">Recommended</span></label><input class=\"input\" name=\"condition\" placeholder=\"Reference or 1500 rpm\"></div><div class=\"field span-2 recommended-field\"><label>Sample / device IDs <span class=\"field-level\">Recommended</span></label><input class=\"input\" name=\"samples\" placeholder=\"S01-A, S01-B\"><small>Creates explicit targets for later Measurements.</small></div></div>\n    <div class=\"stack-tool-layout\"><section class=\"stack-stage\"><header><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Live cross-section</span><strong>Device architecture</strong></div><button class=\"button small\" type=\"button\" data-add-layer>+ Add layer</button></header><div class=\"stack-live\" data-layer-visual></div><div class=\"stack-axis\"><span>Top contact</span><i></i><span>Substrate</span></div></section><section class=\"stack-layer-editor\"><header><strong>Layer specification</strong><small>Reorder from substrate to top contact.</small></header><div data-layer-list></div></section></div>\n    <div class=\"panel-body\"><header class=\"subtool-head\"><div><strong>Fabrication sequence</strong><small>Record only the operations that matter for this specimen.</small></div><button class=\"button small\" type=\"button\" data-add-process>+ Add process</button></header><div data-process-list></div></div>\n    <details class=\"progressive-details progressive-block\"><summary>Recommended fabrication context <span>Optional · useful for reproducibility</span></summary><div class=\"progressive-detail-body form-grid\"><div class=\"field recommended-field\"><label>Atmosphere <span class=\"field-level\">Recommended</span></label><input class=\"input\" name=\"atmosphere\" placeholder=\"e.g. N₂ glovebox\"><small>Useful when comparing fabrication conditions.</small></div><div class=\"field\"><label>Instrument / setup</label><input class=\"input\" name=\"instrument\" placeholder=\"Spin coater, evaporator…\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label>Operator</label><input class=\"input\" name=\"operator\" placeholder=\"Optional\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label>Notes</label><textarea class=\"input\" name=\"notes\" rows=\"2\"></textarea></div><label class=\"check-row span-2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"saveCabinet\"><span><strong>Save also to Lab Cabinet</strong><small>The Project keeps an independent snapshot of this stack.</small></span></label></div></details>\n    <div class=\"panel-footer\"><span class=\"subtle\">The ordered layers are the core record. Context can be improved later.</span><button class=\"button primary\" type=\"submit\">Save stack</button></div>\n  </form>\n</section>\n"
