        "htmlContent": "<section class=\"tool-step\" id=\"dataTool\">\n  <header class=\"tool-step-head\">\n    <div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Capture · map · evidence</span><h3>Add scientific measurements</h3><p>Start from what was measured. File format, mapping and provenance are handled underneath.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"row wrap\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"imports.html\">Open advanced ingest</a><label class=\"button\">Quick ingest<input type=\"file\" accept=\".csv,.tsv,.txt,.dat,.asc,.json,.jsonl,.ndjson,.xml,.yaml,.yml,.xy,.jdx,.dx,.xrdml\" data-data-file hidden></label><button class=\"button primary\" type=\"button\" data-data-manual>Manual entry</button></div>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"step-flag\"><span class=\"badge warning\">Session only</span><p>Files are read locally. Scientific data are reset with the demo session and are never uploaded by this POC.</p></div>\n  <fieldset class=\"measurement-step-selector\" data-measurement-selector>\n    <legend>What are you adding?</legend>\n    <label class=\"active\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"step_measurement_type\" value=\"auto\" checked><span class=\"measurement-glyph\">?</span><strong>Auto-detect</strong><small>Headers + filename</small></label>\n    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"step_measurement_type\" value=\"jv\"><span class=\"measurement-glyph\">J↗</span><strong>JV</strong><small>Illuminated</small></label>\n    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"step_measurement_type\" value=\"dark_jv\"><span class=\"measurement-glyph\">J◐</span><strong>Dark JV</strong><small>No illumination</small></label>\n    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"step_measurement_type\" value=\"ipce\"><span class=\"measurement-glyph\">λ%</span><strong>IPCE</strong><small>EQE response</small></label>\n    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"step_measurement_type\" value=\"uvvis\"><span class=\"measurement-glyph\">λA</span><strong>UV/VIS</strong><small>Optical spectrum</small></label>\n    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"step_measurement_type\" value=\"stability\"><span class=\"measurement-glyph\">t→</span><strong>Stability</strong><small>Evolution in time</small></label>\n    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"step_measurement_type\" value=\"generic\"><span class=\"measurement-glyph\">…</span><strong>Other</strong><small>Generic evidence</small></label>\n  </fieldset>\n\n  <div class=\"record-grid measurement-record-grid\" data-data-list></div>\n  <div class=\"useful-empty\" data-data-empty><strong>No session measurements yet</strong><small>Add JV, Dark JV, IPCE, UV/VIS or Stability data. LabFlow will preserve scientific meaning rather than only a filename.</small></div>\n\n  <form class=\"panel tool-editor measurement-editor\" data-data-editor hidden>\n    <div class=\"panel-header\"><div class=\"panel-title\"><strong data-data-title>Measurement</strong><small>Source → meaning → target → scientific preview</small></div><button class=\"icon-button\" type=\"button\" data-data-close aria-label=\"Close\">×</button></div>\n    <div class=\"measurement-editor-detection\" data-measurement-detection></div>\n    <div class=\"panel-body form-grid\">\n      <div class=\"field required-field\"><label>Measurement type <span class=\"field-level\">Required</span></label><select class=\"input\" name=\"measurementType\" required></select><small>The scientific meaning of the data, independent from file extension.</small></div>\n      <div class=\"field required-field\"><label>Target stack <span class=\"field-level\">Required</span></label><select class=\"input\" name=\"stackId\"></select><small>Inherited Project context; no repeated stack metadata.</small></div>\n      <div class=\"field required-field\"><label>Sample / device <span class=\"field-level\">Required</span></label><select class=\"input\" name=\"sample\"></select><small>The physical target characterised by this Measurement.</small></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label>Review state</label><select class=\"input\" name=\"status\"><option>Structured</option><option>Needs review</option></select></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"context-inheritance\"><span data-icon=\"link\"></span><div><strong>Context inherited automatically</strong><small data-inherited-context>Project → Stack → Fabrication → Solutions</small></div><span class=\"badge\">Inherited</span></div></div>\n    <details class=\"progressive-details measurement-recommended\" data-measurement-recommended>\n      <summary>Recommended measurement details <span>Optional · add when useful</span></summary>\n      <div class=\"progressive-detail-body form-grid\">\n        <div class=\"field recommended-field\" data-condition-field=\"activeArea\"><label>Active device area <span class=\"field-level\">Recommended</span></label><input class=\"input\" name=\"activeArea\" placeholder=\"e.g. 0.16 cm²\"><small>Useful for reliable JV comparison and current-density provenance.</small></div>\n        <div class=\"field recommended-field\" data-condition-field=\"instrument\"><label>Instrument / setup <span class=\"field-level\">Recommended</span></label><input class=\"input\" name=\"instrument\" placeholder=\"Instrument or setup\"><small>Improves acquisition provenance.</small></div>\n        <div class=\"field\" data-condition-field=\"illumination\"><label>Illumination</label><input class=\"input\" name=\"illumination\" placeholder=\"e.g. AM1.5G · 100 mW/cm²\"></div>\n        <div class=\"field\" data-condition-field=\"environment\"><label>Environment</label><input class=\"input\" name=\"environment\" placeholder=\"e.g. N₂ · 25 °C · 40% RH\"></div>\n        <div class=\"field span-2\" data-condition-field=\"protocol\"><label>Protocol / acquisition note</label><input class=\"input\" name=\"protocol\" placeholder=\"Scan direction, MPPT, cadence…\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n    <div class=\"panel-body\" data-column-mapping></div>\n    <div class=\"panel-body\"><div data-data-preview></div></div>\n    <div class=\"panel-body\" data-manual-rows hidden><header class=\"subtool-head\"><div><strong>Measured values</strong><small>Use manual entry for a summary or a small measurement series.</small></div><button class=\"button small\" type=\"button\" data-add-metric>+ Add value</button></header><div data-metric-list></div></div>\n    <div class=\"panel-footer\"><span class=\"subtle\" data-save-readiness>Required context is enough to continue; recommended metadata never blocks saving.</span><button class=\"button primary\" type=\"submit\">Save measurement</button></div>\n  </form>\n</section>\n"
